    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=\\frac37$",
      "worked": "The original denominators require $x\\ne-1,1$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{4(x-1)+3(x+1)}{(x+1)(x-1)}&=\\frac2{(x+1)(x-1)}\\\\4(x-1)+3(x+1)&=2\\\\7x-1&=2\\\\7x&=3\\\\x&=\\frac37\\end{align*}$$\n\nThis value is permitted.",
